  "description": "A comprehensive document chunking library for .NET that intelligently splits various document formats (Markdown, HTML, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, CSV, PDF, Plain Text) into semantic chunks optimized for RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) and LLM processing. Features include hierarchical chunking, token counting, quality metrics, and support for multiple document formats.",
