  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.9.0 (Beta Release)\n\t\t\t- Initial beta release with 9 document formats supported\n\t\t\t- Markdown, HTML, Plain Text, DOCX, PPTX, XLSX, CSV, PDF (basic text extraction)\n\t\t\t- 409 tests with 100% pass rate\n\t\t\t- Hierarchical chunking with parent-child relationships\n\t\t\t- OpenAI token counting support\n\t\t\t- Quality metrics and validation\n\t\t\t- Comprehensive documentation",
